Welcome to Europa, Major. As you know, a Russian convoy left Ganymede with part of the original Pegasus device. It is due to reach the CCA base very soon, but we do not know which path it will take. You must steal the information from the Russian communications tower, so that we can plant explosives by the path it will use. Once we have done that, you are to make your way to the explosives, and set them off as the convoy passes.

MISSION OBJECTIVES:
- Steal the convoy's route plans from the Communication Tower.
- Destroy the convoy before it reaches the CCA base.